{"4840050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Buried Life", "steam_appid": 4840050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of adventure, you and your friends set out to explore an abandoned mine. After a sudden collapse, you become separated from the group and, while searching for a way back to the surface, discover something that should never have existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep beneath the earth lies a secret Soviet research complex whose existence was never officially acknowledged. Decades ago, the facility was completely isolated from the outside world, and all information about the experiments conducted there vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/ea559f9fd97a3ed459e5b2fb04bc70b0.poster.avif?t=1786502097\" width=1024 height=778 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/ea559f9fd97a3ed459e5b2fb04bc70b0.webm?t=1786502097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/ea559f9fd97a3ed459e5b2fb04bc70b0.mp4?t=1786502097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore abandoned laboratories and tunnels as you uncover the history of the complex. Project Collie was created to grant a living creature intelligence and freedom from death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you descend underground, the more questions arise. Why was the complex sealed off? What happened to its personnel? And is everything buried beneath the mountain truly dead?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/5baf151b416cfab5307ee7344b9c928a.poster.avif?t=1786502097\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/5baf151b416cfab5307ee7344b9c928a.webm?t=1786502097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/5baf151b416cfab5307ee7344b9c928a.mp4?t=1786502097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buried Life is an atmospheric first-person adventure featuring exploration, puzzles, and psychological horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• An abandoned Soviet research complex hidden from the outside world for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The secrets of Project Collie and Project Newtonia, buried deep underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exploration of laboratories, mines, and technical tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Documents, tapes, and recordings that reveal the fate of the complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Interactive environments and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choices that influence the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• An atmospheric adventure with psychological horror elements.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of adventure, you and your friends set out to explore an abandoned mine. After a sudden collapse, you become separated from the group and, while searching for a way back to the surface, discover something that should never have existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep beneath the earth lies a secret Soviet research complex whose existence was never officially acknowledged. Decades ago, the facility was completely isolated from the outside world, and all information about the experiments conducted there vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/ea559f9fd97a3ed459e5b2fb04bc70b0.poster.avif?t=1786502097\" width=1024 height=778 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/ea559f9fd97a3ed459e5b2fb04bc70b0.webm?t=1786502097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/ea559f9fd97a3ed459e5b2fb04bc70b0.mp4?t=1786502097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore abandoned laboratories and tunnels as you uncover the history of the complex. Project Collie was created to grant a living creature intelligence and freedom from death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you descend underground, the more questions arise. Why was the complex sealed off? What happened to its personnel? And is everything buried beneath the mountain truly dead?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/5baf151b416cfab5307ee7344b9c928a.poster.avif?t=1786502097\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/5baf151b416cfab5307ee7344b9c928a.webm?t=1786502097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/extras/5baf151b416cfab5307ee7344b9c928a.mp4?t=1786502097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buried Life is an atmospheric first-person adventure featuring exploration, puzzles, and psychological horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• An abandoned Soviet research complex hidden from the outside world for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The secrets of Project Collie and Project Newtonia, buried deep underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exploration of laboratories, mines, and technical tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Documents, tapes, and recordings that reveal the fate of the complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Interactive environments and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choices that influence the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• An atmospheric adventure with psychological horror elements.</p>", "short_description": "1997. After a sudden mine collapse, you find yourself trapped inside an abandoned Soviet research complex where classified experiments were once conducted. Explore underground laboratories, uncover forgotten secrets, and discover why the facility was buried along with everything it contained.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/383b885e6e14d76cc0ef985ed031ee5f8d2e9d6c/header.jpg?t=1786502097", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/6323bae7e45901dc84ffc1f7481426c5a3591603/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786502097", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4840050/6323bae7e45901dc84ffc1f7481426c5a3591603/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786502097", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (20H1 version or newer, 64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 580 8GB or GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 60 FPS, 1920x1080 in low</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (20H1 version or newer, 64-bit vers